    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_397_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So this is...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.3
    },
    {
        "text": "The giant door lies solemnly in the underground area. There is not a sound to be heard aside from the breathing of those who have made their way here."
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course, death is silent. Not even the most glorious reign can change that fact."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Mausoleum of Kings... Just as its name suggests... this is the resting place of all Victoria's kings.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you hear something?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_396_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nothing besides our breathing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dagda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "There is no mistaking that there is some kind of sound echoing throughout this space."
    },
    {
        "text": "Is it a murmur she hears, having woken up from her dream, or is it a groan she owes to her fatigue?"
    },
    {
        "text": "They are staring at her."
    },
    {
        "text": "<i>Victoria</i> is staring at her."
    },
    {
        "text": "The moment she comes to realize this, a sense of agitation immediately follows."
    },
    {
        "text": "What do they expect? What kind of future are they envisioning for her?"
    },
    {
        "text": "She grew tired of these days on the run long ago."
    },
    {
        "text": "And it has been a very long time since she last heeded the call of that golden creature."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.6,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "Golden mane...",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Come. We need to finish this mission as fast as we can.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rhodes Island and the Corps will need our help.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4062_totter_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Totter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4062_totter_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stop!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Totter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4062_totter_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's this... on the ground...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Totter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_155_tiger_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's too dark here... I thought this was some of that upper crust posh decor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is blood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4062_totter_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Signs of a fight here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Totter"
    },
    {
        "text": "An utterly tragic battle... No, this place is a mire soaked in death.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Totter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "A meandering trail of blood can be found having slithering down the pathway and past the gap beneath the door. Or perhaps it crept its way out the large door."
    },
    {
        "text": "The trail of blood has long since dried, leaving the shattered bricks on the ground covered in its twisted, dark crimson stains."
    },
    {
        "text": "Likewise, there are tattered bolt heads, sword fragments, and craters left behind by Arts explosions, all submerged under the bed of dried blood."
    },
    {
        "text": "There are also marks more massive in scale, such as the numerous scars on the door, each one by itself more than enough to tear the silence of this place asunder."
    },
    {
        "text": "Although there are no bodies to be seen, everyone who seen war before can easily work out what transpired here."
    },
    {
        "text": "Two groups, both prepared to fight to the death, battled each other. Evidently, they got their wish."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4062_totter_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Judging from the color of the blood, this must be at least several years old.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Totter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_397_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Several years... You don't mean...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_396_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Sarkaz.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dagda"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sarkaz died here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dagda"
    },
    {
        "text": "I recognize their weapons. They're... the same ones the Sarkaz warriors who attacked the Knights of the Tower used all those years ago.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dagda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4062_totter_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "They're different from what the Sarkaz outside are using.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Totter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_396_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Completely different.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dagda"
    },
    {
        "text": "The blades that the Sarkaz use now are all made in the munitions factories in Highbury, and they're very similar to the standard weapons used by the Victorian Army.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dagda"
    },
    {
        "text": "They're not as crude, and nowhere near as... barbaric.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dagda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_396_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I still remember... the sounds of their rusted blades cutting through my fellow knights. They were heavy, and they'd shatter bone before crushing armor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dagda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dagda, are you alright?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_396_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm fine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dagda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_396_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "If the sight of these battle scars was enough to stop me in my tracks, I probably wouldn't have been able to manage a single peaceful night since my escape from Londinium.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dagda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#4$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Vina... The situation's not quite what we expected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#4$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#4$1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "The sound hurts her head."
    },
    {
        "text": "They are urging her. They are speaking."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#4$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The Sighs of Kings is still inside.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "text": "Keep calm and carry on.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
