    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "32_g8_kingrestpath",
        "screenadapt": "showall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_4062_totter_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Who fought the Sarkaz?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_4062_totter_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "There's no way to tell.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Totter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_4062_totter_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The other side left no traces?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_4062_totter_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "If they did, it's likely I haven't seen them before.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Totter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_4062_totter_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Mr. Totter. How long has it been since you became a mercenary?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_4062_totter_1#8$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It'll be my fourteenth anniversary next month.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Totter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_4062_totter_1#8$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You must've seen weapons from most countries out there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_4062_totter_1#8$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Certainly, but not every country out there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Totter"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm just your garden variety merc. I haven't seen the weapons of any particularly elite forces.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Totter"
    },
    {
        "text": "If I had, I wouldn't be alive right now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Totter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_4062_totter_1#8$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4062_totter_1#8$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Morgan, Indra. Head back outside the path and stay alert.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Secure our evac route, just like before, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I hope I don't miss out on anything good.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_396_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Siege, we can't act rashly now...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dagda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you hear the battle above us, Dagda?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_396_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dagda"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I do. This trembling... I can imagine it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't go back empty-handed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "text": "If the sword will stop all of this, or even just ease all the sacrifice and slaughter...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then I shall do it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "text": "I do not see this as a responsibility. It's just... a tiny act on my part.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's nothing different from knocking out the front teeth of those thugs who come looking for trouble.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_397_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Vina...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Allerdale, you said it yourself. Having taken this step, we can't turn back now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
