    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#8$1",
        "fadetime": 0.7,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#8$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You look pretty cheesed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#8$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph, this was my chance to fight right beneath the palace!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#8$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I just hope they don't actually run into anything that calls for a fight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#8$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Eh, you should know what a big sacrifice I'm making for you. If someone whacks you in one go, you've got to have a friend to yell for the others, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#8$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha, my silly Hannah.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#8$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you remember how Vina looked when we first met her?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "How could I forget?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "text": "She was real cocky.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "She was tiny, but she was full of herself, she hardly talked. You couldn't even tell when she was angry, but when she fought...",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha... Who do you reckon taught her how to fight?",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "She said it was her teacher.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "text": "And I thought she had some brawler from Norport for a teacher.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then we found out about who she was, and it all made sense. Probably a knight with muscles for brains.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Seriously, though, aren't princes and princesses all meant to wear frilly clothes and have trouble running? What kind of teacher would have her fighting like she's facing a wild beast?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha, when she first told us who she was, I thought she was having a laugh.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#8$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Vina wouldn't kid about something where life and death is concerned.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#8$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I thought it was a new gang looking for trouble with Glasgow.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#8$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "But it turns out it was an operation to assassinate the heir to the throne? Hah.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "They were pretty tough, though.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I thought it'd be a lot more fun to follow a crown princess on an adventure than living the thug life. Besides, this princess has got a special place in my heart.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "text": "Before I knew it, we were following Vina out of Londinium, wandering the world with her, and making it back here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now... If the heroes in the legends had a choice, they'd rather lie down on the sofa and gulp down a cold beer, wouldn't you agree?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#10$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Having second thoughts?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#10$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course not. We've come this far already.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "text": "I started on my memoirs already, and I'm going to make a huge with the book! It's called <i>The Legendary Vina and Her Legendary Mates</i>. All I need now is a publisher.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "With your sorry vocabulary? Forget it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Vina said it was cool!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "text": "This reminds me... of that pub that we smashed the sign of.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That was the first battle we won with Vina leading us!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That night, we drank all the booze in their cellar. In the end, Baird carried us back to the lorry, one by one, and drove us home before the police got there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#9$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you bloody daft? I was the one who carried you on my back. Baird was so off her trolley, she tried to steer the loo! And you wanted her to drive?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indra"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#9$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#9$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "All I'm thinking is... No matter where we are, we can still come together and make a name for ourselves, right? Even if it's just taking over a pub from the other gangs.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "text": "Say, Hannah...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_405_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_155_tiger_1#9$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We've been back for days already. Why hasn't Vina so much as suggested paying Glasgow a visit?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Morgan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
