    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The key.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Before we left, the Doctor gave me this key.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Doctor told me that Dr. Kal'tsit negotiated for this... Only this can open the door that leads to the Mausoleum of Kings.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know this key once belonged to a Draco.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Allerdale.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you know... where the other key is?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#1$1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The other key."
    },
    {
        "text": "The key that belonged to the Aslan royal family. It, too, can open this door, and it should have been passed to her by her father, but she has never seen the key herself."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#9$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Why ask me that, all of a sudden?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#9$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I just remembered... another legend about the Sighs of Kings.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.6,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "'With the sword in his hand, the Aslan padishah tried to conquer the last swath of foreign land.'",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "'The Draco king's fire Arts flew straight toward him. His armor burned away in the flames, disappearing in purplish drops. However, his sword was far harder than his armor.'",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "'The moment it pierced the Draco king's body, only half of the Aslan padishah's sword remained.'",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "'And so, the Draco king lived, and the Aslan padishah lost his right hand.'",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle",
        "text": "'After the Draco and the Aslan signed their treaty, the sword was reforged, and it has since become the symbol of Victoria's centuries-long glory.'",
        "x": 300,
        "y": 370,
        "alignment": "center",
        "size": 24,
        "delay": 0.04,
        "width": 700
    },
    {
        "tag": "subtitle"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#7$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "My ancestors... once nearly killed a Draco king.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "text": "And now I hold the key of the Red Dragon's descendants...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#7$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...to open the door to the Mausoleum of Kings.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Siege"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#7$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Here, it doesn't matter whether one is Draco or Aslan\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_407_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_397_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "One is only Victoria.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Allerdale"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
